docs/design.md
The files in the orchestrator/ directory are:                                   

 1 bench_local30_gen.py - Generates Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B candidates on the frozen
   hard-30 dataset using Ollama's endpoint                                      
 2 bench_local30_grade.py - Grades the local 30B candidates against H200-served 
   80B candidates using a gpt-5.2 grader                                        

The bench_local30_gen.py script:                                                

 1 Reads a hard-30 query set from eval_queryset_hard.py                         
 2 For each query, sends it to an Ollama endpoint running Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B   
 3 Saves results incrementally to eval_candidates_local30_hard.json             
 4 Supports resuming from partial runs                                          
 5 Includes a demo mode for offline testing                                     

The bench_local30_grade.py script:                                              

 1 Merges the local 30B results with pre-computed 80B results                   
 2 Uses a gpt-5.2 grader to score both models on the same queries               
 3 Compares performance between the 30B and 80B models                          
 4 Outputs head-to-head win statistics                                          
 5 Includes a demo mode for offline testing                                     

Both scripts are designed to run in a local-first workflow where the 30B model  
is tested locally before running on the H200-served 80B model.                  

